  libuna-devel-20260602-1bl2
  make-4.4.1-2
  python3-3.12.12-1
  python3-devel-3.12.12-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libolecf

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libolecf/archive/refs/tags/20260526.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libolecf-20260526-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libolecf-20260526-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libolecf-20260526-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libolecf-20260526-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libolecf1-20260526-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libolecf-devel-20260526-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libolecf-20260526-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libolecf)
  /usr/bin/olecfexport.exe
  /usr/bin/olecfinfo.exe
  /usr/bin/olecfmount.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libolecf.README
  /usr/share/doc/libolecf/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libolecf/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libolecf/COPYING.LESSER
  /usr/share/doc/libolecf/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libolecf/README
  /usr/share/man/man1/olecfexport.1.gz
  /usr/share/man/man1/olecfinfo.1.gz

(libolecf1)
  /usr/bin/cygolecf-1.dll

(libolecf-devel)
  /usr/include/libolecf.h
  /usr/include/libolecf/codepage.h
  /usr/include/libolecf/definitions.h
  /usr/include/libolecf/error.h
  /usr/include/libolecf/extern.h
  /usr/include/libolecf/features.h
  /usr/include/libolecf/ole.h
  /usr/include/libolecf/types.h
  /usr/lib/libolecf.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libolecf.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libolecf.3.gz

(python312-libolecf)
  /usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pyolecf.dll

